window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Lady Iolanthe of Rockmourn Keep expects to be a spinster all her days. She is very tall. She is very poor. And she is thirty. What lord could possibly want her?</p> <p>But then her father returns with news that he has found a bridegroom for her—one that is impressively tall. One that is strong, and bold, and wealthy. And best of all? He wants Iolanthe. It seems too good to be true.</p> <p>And when Iolanthe gets her first look at her husband-to-be, she realizes why.</p> <p>No one mentioned the 'orc' part of things . . .</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
